				<wikidot:authorName>September Burns</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1313339</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I love this. It is just an excellent, excellent piece of writing, and one of the few that has actually managed to disturb me. For some reason, the bit at the end about the dog with a big mouth was very unsettling. Beautiful work.</p> <p>I think it has something to do with how well you capture the feeling of complete <em>helplessness</em> in the character.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
